This product bundles two single-file libraries, fetched at pinned revisions
and compiled into the library at build time (src/render3d_thirdparty.c).

stb_image (https://github.com/nothings/stb), the picture decoder, by Sean
Barrett and contributors. It is offered under two licenses, MIT or public
domain; this product takes it under the MIT License:

